    "v2_flexible_XDXkJK": {
      "type": "v2_flexible",
      "blocks": {
        "headline_9Ey8px": {
          "type": "headline",
          "settings": {
            "heading_text": "<p>Step 4: Start earning</p>",
            "heading_align": "left",
            "heading_width": "full",
            "heading_type": "h3",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_no_decal": false,
            "heading_decal_left": true,
            "heading_strong_accented": false
          }
        },
        "textcol_C8739a": {
          "type": "textcol",
          "settings": {
            "left_text": "<p></p><p>Once you’re qualified, we don’t leave you hanging. As one of the UK’s top-rated training providers, <strong>we’ve built partnerships with leading gyms across the country</strong> —including The Gym Group, Virgin Active, and more. <strong>Learners get access to guaranteed job interviews</strong>, giving you a clear pathway into paid employment, check out our <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Career Support page</strong></span> to learn more.</p>",
            "left_text_size": "copy-l",
            "left_text_no_decal": false,
            "left_text_strong_accented": true,
            "right_text": "<p></p><p>Want a career that <strong>pays well, fits around your life, and doesn’t require a university degree</strong>? Becoming a Wellness Personal Trainer opens the door to flexible, rewarding jobs that <strong>keep you active, fulfilled, and in control of your time</strong>. Whether you want to work in gyms, run sessions in the community, coach clients online, or build your own wellness brand, it all starts here.</p>",
            "right_text_size": "copy-l",
            "right_text_no_decal": false,
            "right_text_strong_accented": true,
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "headline_9Ey8px",
        "textcol_C8739a"
      ],
      "name": "t:lesections.flexible.presets.name",
      "settings": {
